      Terrain</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4104.0,"y":1830.0},"guid":"c49a9d97-b4e2-479d-8952-efcceee3525f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"24"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":-3842.0,"y":1735.0},"guid":"df49f50d-83a1-42c2-8d34-3ce6bc887f82","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"26"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF2","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1317.0,"y":4158.0},"guid":"032a430c-7e70-4d8f-8274-1260d45e0d23","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"28"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"The
      regulars are marching on Lexington. Our militia is forming now nearby the Green.\\n\\nGive
      the order, and we will take our positions.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-2368.0,"y":1162.0},"guid":"43ef772b-204d-4cb1-810e-5c3e82ab81e9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"30"},{"type":"System.Boolean","value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":468.0,"y":621.0},"guid":"7563874e-8726-4183-b07f-692f61264cd9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"32"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["text"],"member":{"name":"SetText","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"TMPTXT","targetTypeName":"TMPTXT","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%text":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":242.0,"y":-400.0},"guid":"ac0c8b31-2ca1-4261-99b1-f0b3f37d3576","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"34"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"cam","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":-223.0},"guid":"8e543c5f-193f-4003-a539-43587b4396a5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"38"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>Fear
      in the Ranks</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":552.0},"guid":"ab024443-3895-416e-b5ae-f1989dd81123","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"40"},{"argumentCount":1,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"Bunker
      Hill","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-1504.0,"y":460.0},"guid":"17cb7bd2-8b05-4002-86e8-58dc0f313936","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>Command
      Your Men</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-21.0,"y":3025.0},"guid":"07a9b6e7-9c08-4d88-9bd9-067edec64562","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"44"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-1345.0,"y":3296.0},"guid":"87c93df5-216b-4fd3-b04e-157cbe94a2f0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"46"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":658.0,"y":3393.0},"guid":"0e307f31-3209-431a-8722-8e3e029bdf9e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"50"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Through
      the night, your men have <b>raised fresh fortifications</b> atop this hill.
      They are <color=#C9C9C9>rough</color>. They are <color=#C9C9C9>incomplete</color>.
      They are all that stand before the enemy now.\\n\\n<b><color=#B22222>The British
      are coming.</color></b>\\nTheir ranks are trained, their bayonets fixed, and
      their cannon will not spare this ground.\\n\\nYou command a <b><color=#FF5C5C>desperate
      defense</color></b>. <b>Hold the line.</b> Make every shot count.\\n\\nIf they
      take this hill, make them <b><color=#FF3B30>fear the price.</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-1246.0,"y":370.0},"guid":"73b52bb8-cafa-4698-b726-5d948cc59f6b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"54"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GUY","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":842.0,"y":3269.0},"guid":"c05dae76-69d9-4244-b62b-f35f950d2c2b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"56"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":253.0,"y":2526.0},"guid":"0681fdbb-52af-4655-8e06-f4434f94a0a8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"58"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Deadb","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":420.0,"y":3815.0},"guid":"b01fe4db-0bfb-4e81-81cd-0a3f02572b61","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"60"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"pos","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1165.0,"y":-317.0},"guid":"303b0ac8-cd1e-4046-8ff8-fe66dcc048d8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"62"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF1","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1506.0,"y":1587.0},"guid":"4a6a8553-918c-4c79-8ad7-2b911835ab7f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"64"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Button","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":230.0,"y":-528.0},"guid":"1653b8e9-355f-41e4-bb7e-549903313cab","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"66"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF2","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1312.0,"y":3154.0},"guid":"19509bab-60f2-46d2-8109-e43ca44409e9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"68"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-1517.0,"y":3297.0},"guid":"88a48e5e-768d-4093-97f5-e236ccfa0a6d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"70"},{"argumentCount":1,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"HealthB","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-437.0,"y":1509.0},"guid":"08ae7170-c309-4471-9df7-95e2b41791cc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"74"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Morale","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-190.0,"y":626.0},"guid":"a8c4ddaf-a85b-4d6a-8eba-d456a6d717ef","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"76"},{"type":"UnityEngine.Vector3","value":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-1228.0,"y":766.0},"guid":"3d76588a-8408-414b-a74d-08e345780e7b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"78"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF2","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1314.0,"y":1601.0},"guid":"c6be2004-4a67-400a-a9d8-70fd52acdfb8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"80"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF1","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1504.0,"y":3140.0},"guid":"e94b2892-a06d-4f66-b6c0-975992f53e94","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"82"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":463.0,"y":-384.0},"guid":"a091604a-622b-46b0-9f8e-153c1bfac977","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"84"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"We
      are driving the British back now, but do not grow careless. In a worse fight,
      low ammunition would not mean danger. It would mean death.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-44.0,"y":3305.0},"guid":"c737724f-554e-4309-a985-96814577cf15","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"88"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"GO
      TO","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-33.0,"y":3128.0},"guid":"34755d2d-b829-4b2f-a8d9-4c243be630b0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"90"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"TextTitle","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":16.0,"y":-550.0},"guid":"70b9f67a-bf34-49e6-bdbd-9c5c64eb03e0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"92"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Wave1","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":442.0,"y":1987.0},"guid":"5e238990-67d1-4951-bd83-bb15d930ae79","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"94"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Hill","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":459.0,"y":2540.0},"guid":"d6a830c8-cc23-44d6-89de-51de184644c1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"96"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-1519.0,"y":1744.0},"guid":"2bf07c77-9f88-469e-8c1c-00ba71a79c12","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"98"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":2516.0,"y":3159.0},"guid":"cbba4301-35c7-40b9-8c4e-914cb0631a74","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"102"},{"type":"UnityEngine.Vector3","value":{"x":143.45,"y":-32.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":222.0,"y":2239.0},"guid":"c4394515-6818-4e46-8833-3b952395c088","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"106"},{"type":"System.Boolean","value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":462.0,"y":1669.0},"guid":"3f5d215c-77c0-4fe3-ae37-a2dff02500eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"108"},{"argumentCount":1,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"Hill","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-409.0,"y":2532.0},"guid":"10c5c191-eef8-487a-a5a9-d2495d9f0ae0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"110"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Click","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":446.0,"y":2950.0},"guid":"e584b9af-4a98-42df-8cfa-668afcdb0092","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"112"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"GO
      TO","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-18.0,"y":1703.0},"guid":"8ec36103-7a1a-456e-9775-1c98a68eb07f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"114"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"pos","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1632.0,"y":-258.0},"guid":"da469f45-d814-450c-b4f8-08bc303a4078","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"116"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":261.0,"y":463.0},"guid":"e10fe2bf-2623-4145-8f18-875f8da14a42","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"118"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Morale","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":467.0,"y":477.0},"guid":"f2c71b84-ed7d-465f-9f23-a9f87c2262d1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"120"},{"argumentCount":4,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Alert","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":-984.0,"y":445.0},"guid":"2392e8b7-21a2-4dd9-b928-156543bbffc4","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"122"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"The
      British have taken their first losses, and a cry rises from your men: <b><color=#4DA6FF>\u201cHuzzah!\u201d</color></b>\\n\\nFor
      a moment, fear gives way to defiance. The enemy can bleed. The King''s soldiers
      can fall.\\n\\nLet this lift the line, Commander, but do not be fooled. The
      British are still coming, and they will answer blood with more blood.\\n\\nHold
      fast. Your men have seen that the redcoats can die.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-9.0,"y":1444.0},"guid":"d4150c7d-edcb-4aac-b3b6-91ff2a377621","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"124"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-140.0,"y":1526.0},"guid":"35847866-50cb-4263-af40-de6b1028e41c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"126"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"pos","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-462.0,"y":-414.0},"guid":"e784748b-d8ed-42c0-9866-28acd42da828","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"128"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"These
      points are the spine of your defense, Commander. So long as <b><color=#4DA6FF>even
      one remains in your hands</color></b>, the line still stands.\\n\\nIf you <b><color=#4CAF50>defend
      every point</color></b>, you will <b><color=#4CAF50>win the battle</color></b>.\\n\\nBut
      if the British seize <b><color=#FF5C5C>all of them</color></b>, your defense
      will collapse and <b><color=#B22222>the hill will be lost</color></b>.\\n\\nHold
      each position. Yield nothing without cost.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":859.0,"y":-147.0},"guid":"25d9288c-3a0c-43a6-9e00-0dd145dd3f7f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"130"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>The
      First Wave</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-25.0,"y":2062.0},"guid":"5d414fe5-0705-4ffb-860e-17c8f17da4f8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"132"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GUY","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1718.0,"y":1122.0},"guid":"b3060da0-3d14-4906-8cf4-9d3e0c907477","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"134"},{"type":"System.Boolean","value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":443.0,"y":2131.0},"guid":"cf58f438-8dee-4dbc-8fdc-98a8e7dd1987","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"136"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>Hold
      the Strongpoints</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":860.0,"y":17.0},"guid":"269b70ca-aa1f-4c7e-9def-9bc56417df58","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"138"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"The
      <b><color=#B22222>first British wave</color></b> is upon you, Commander. Their
      line advances through smoke and thunder, and the hill trembles beneath their
      approach.\\n\\nIf they <b><color=#FF5C5C>break through here</color></b>, fear
      will spread fast. If you <b><color=#4CAF50>throw them back</color></b>, your
      men may yet believe this line can hold.\\n\\n<b><color=#D6B25E>Stand firm</color></b>.
      Meet them with <b><color=#4DA6FF>disciplined fire</color></b>, and make the
      <b><color=#FF5C5C>first assault a costly one</color></b>.\\n\\n<b><color=#C9C9C9>This
      is only the beginning.</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-28.0,"y":1906.0},"guid":"88f6a051-3e47-40a4-a849-bd4d5721d085","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"140"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-134.0,"y":478.0},"guid":"61c1c303-ba47-45b4-885e-41ab24fbca63","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"142"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"GO
