      a hill slows a unit and makes it easier to hit. Use that wisely. The same danger
      that threatens your men can punish the British as well.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-11.0,"y":2459.0},"guid":"a59b8c9e-736c-45b7-bed8-eabc82ee4f3e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"188"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-1890.0,"y":1123.0},"guid":"daf3cc85-f44e-48cf-a706-dd61e6348b86","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"190"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-3659.0,"y":2769.0},"guid":"6ba68379-1d5b-4eec-82fb-8b409c50d29d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"192"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Through
      the night, your men have <b>raised fresh fortifications</b> atop this hill.
      They are <color=#C9C9C9>rough</color>. They are <color=#C9C9C9>incomplete</color>.
      They are all that stand before the enemy now.\\n\\n<b><color=#B22222>The British
      are coming.</color></b>\\nTheir ranks are trained, their bayonets fixed, and
      their cannon will not spare this ground.\\n\\nYou command a <b><color=#FF5C5C>desperate
      defense</color></b>. <b>Hold the line.</b> Make every shot count.\\n\\nIf they
      take this hill, make them <b><color=#FF3B30>fear the price.</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-94.0,"y":-169.0},"guid":"d4d7c6b1-f2a3-47cf-95cd-6c480d5b785a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"196"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GIF5","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-3063.0,"y":2624.0},"guid":"6a7e3d5a-62e6-400a-ad5d-0ec733501f0b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"198"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-1730.0,"y":1245.0},"guid":"c2b976aa-57dc-433f-859e-8c9d30c0a199","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"200"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Close","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4117.0,"y":2950.0},"guid":"476e7cec-785d-46da-9b02-6c3a84de2938","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"204"},{"type":"UnityEngine.Vector3","value":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4099.0,"y":2581.0},"guid":"3f7b8749-b306-444e-8fa5-45d839dbc479","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"206"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-3487.0,"y":2768.0},"guid":"d0b6bc2f-cb6c-431f-9cfa-a074e671749b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"208"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","default