      Range</color></b>","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4105.0,"y":2847.0},"guid":"ed01b348-2367-4373-9282-5693036b0851","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"244"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Press
      1, 2, or 3 to set your firing range.\\n1 is Close, 2 is Medium, and 3 is Far.\\nLonger
      range reaches farther, but does less damage.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4106.0,"y":2683.0},"guid":"b45bfc60-c97d-4a09-b188-d4f6cfd130dd","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"246"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"Next","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4128.0,"y":2452.0},"guid":"6c8d2c03-7ee2-4a0d-aa45-8b893fadc5b6","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"248"},{"argumentCount":0,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"ShootC","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-4361.0,"y":2268.0},"guid":"4601152a-13ea-456d-9717-24e69a9cf05d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"250"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-3651.0,"y":2269.0},"guid":"7fac05f6-75db-463b-813a-64cc7e1553f1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"252"},{"type":"System.Boolean","value":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":447.0,"y":3094.0},"guid":"697a3267-1794-4ca1-b170-cb5f4587018a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"256"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"GUY","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-3467.0,"y":2145.0},"guid":"29979322-39d0-44b6-91ee-54a04bcfcba3","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"258"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Wave1","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-215.0,"y":2136.0},"guid":"5d9b78f7-5591-4db4-95ce-6617c34c2b13","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"260"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-1910.0,"y":1746.0},"guid":"94063ecf-3cf8-4bce-90fe-a952b1ce4866","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"262"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"The
      British are farther off, and the hill favors us.\\nSet your range farther to
      reach them.\\nIt will do less damage, but it will keep the pressure on.","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-4117.0,"y":2185.0},"guid":"abb3c296-7515-42de-a8ab-413add08b4fe","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"266"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Panel","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":462.0,"y":-511.0},"guid":"3521b011-b768-4a78-a27b-f0ec63f80564","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"268"},{"kind":"Graph","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Ammo","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":426.0,"y":3386.0},"guid":"e7e572b7-b8ad-489a-bfc0-2020526744bf","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"270"},{"argumentCount":0,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"Shoot","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-2592.0,"y":2784.0},"guid":"a8731144-84d9-49d0-9270-40aacec1df67","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"272"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["value"],"member":{"name":"SetActive","parameterTypes":["System.Boolean"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%value":{"$content":true,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":830.0,"y":3392.0},"guid":"f30b69bd-a36d-4dfb-8d5b-79b29361a081","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"274"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["text"],"member":{"name":"SetText","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"TMPTXT","targetTypeName":"TMPTXT","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null,"%text":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-190.0,"y":-406.0},"guid":"dc9f7d5a-9492-4d45-abfc-03577780f687","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"278"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-155.0,"y":2951.0},"guid":"087fae31-a48b-418e-bc85-ff