      shot rings out from somewhere in the green.\\n\\nThe war has begun...\\nNow
      you must fire back!","$type":"System.String"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-2348.0,"y":2701.0},"guid":"64ab6244-2674-4b03-9112-27ea5e179322","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"288"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"TextMain","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-198.0,"y":-586.0},"guid":"496fc1ad-69e2-460b-ab0e-36c7489966d5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"290"},{"type":"System.String","value":{"$content":"<b><color=#D6B25E>CAPTAIN
